THAT ONE FRIEND AT SCHOOL — third-party material

MUSIC
- Frédéric Chopin, Nocturne in E-flat major, Op. 9 No. 2 (composition: public domain).
  Recording: "Musopen – The Complete Works of Frédéric Chopin" (Musopen Kickstarter project, 2012), dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
  Source: https://archive.org/details/musopen-chopin-complete-works-flac  (file "Nocturne in E flat major, Op. 9 no. 2.flac")
  Used as recorded for the opening, classroom and ending; time-stretched for the montage; slowed and filtered for the post-exam scene. Level-ridden for small speakers.
- Montage percussion, the reveal sting, the phone jingle: synthesised in mix.py (original).

